{
    "name": "Webinar No-Show Tagger",
    "nodes": [
        {
            "parameters": {
                "content": "## Webinar No-Show Tagger\n\n**ONE-TIME SETUP in Set: Config node:**\n- kit_api_secret: Kit \u003e Settings \u003e Advanced \u003e API Secret\n- webinar_attended_tag_id: Kit \u003e Tags \u003e click tag \u003e copy ID from URL\n\nno-show tag is already set to ID 19804957.\n\n**Flow:**\n1. Gets all Kit subscribers with webinar-attended tag\n2. Gets Postgres registrants from last 7 days\n3. Per registrant: NOT in attended list? Adds no-show tag\n4. Already attended? Skips silently\n\nRuns every Monday at 9am. 1 per second rate limit.",
                "height": 400,
                "width": 500,
                "color": 5
            },
            "id": "sticky-ns-main",
            "name": "Sticky: Setup",
            "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
            "typeVersion": 1,
            "position": [
                -240,
                -320
            ]
        },
        {
            "parameters": {
                "rule": {
                    "interval": [
                        {
                            "field": "weeks",
                            "triggerAtDay": [
                                1
                            ],
                            "triggerAtHour": 9
                        }
                    ]
                }
            },
            "id": "1edb3f58-9c7c-4075-ba28-120ae71a6bd3",
            "name": "Weekly Schedule",
            "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
            "typeVersion": 1.2,
            "position": [
                0,
                0
            ]
        },
        {
            "parameters": {
                "values": {
                    "string": [
                        {
                            "value": "KIT_API_SECRET",
                            "name": "kit_api_secret"
                        },
                        {
                            "value": "WEBINAR_ATTENDED_TAG_ID",
                            "name": "webinar_attended_tag_id"
                        }
                    ]
                },
                "options": {}
            },
            "id": "set-config-ns-001",
            "name": "Set: Config",
            "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
            "typeVersion": 1,
            "position": [
                256,
                0
            ]
        },
        {
            "parameters": {
                "url": "={{ \u0027https://api.convertkit.com/v3/subscribers?api_secret=\u0027 + $json.kit_api_secret + \u0027\u0026tag_id=\u0027 + $json.webinar_attended_tag_id + \u0027\u0026per_page=1000\u0027 }}",
                "options": {}
            },
            "id": "http-kit-attended-001",
            "name": "HTTP: Kit -- Get Attended Subscribers",
            "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
            "typeVersion": 3,
            "position": [
                512,
                0
            ],
            "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
        },
        {
            "parameters": {
                "operation": "executeQuery",
                "query": "SELECT email, first_name, webinar_id FROM webinar_registrants WHERE registered_at \u003e= NOW() - INTERVAL \u00277 days\u0027 ORDER BY registered_at DESC",
                "options": {}
            },
            "id": "f5d3a494-426a-4c8b-bd2e-691eb3c300fa",
            "name": "Get Registrants (Last 7 Days)",
            "type": "n8n-nodes-base.postgres",
            "typeVersion": 2.6,
            "position": [
                768,
                0
            ],
            "executeOnce": true,
            "credentials": {
                "postgres": {
                    "id": "vHzmmnuirqKCSruC",
                    "name": "Postgres account"
                }
            }
        },
        {
            "parameters": {
                "jsCode": "const subs = ($(\"HTTP: Kit -- Get Attended Subscribers\").first().json.subscribers || []);\nconst attendedEmails = new Set(subs.map(s =\u003e (s.email_address || \"\").toLowerCase().trim()));\nconst email = ($json.email || \"\").toLowerCase().trim();\nreturn [{ json: { email: $json.email, first_name: $json.first_name || \"\", webinar_id: $json.webinar_id || \"\", is_attended: attendedEmails.has(email) ? 1 : 0 } }];"
            },
            "id": "code-flag-attended-001",
            "name": "Code: Flag Attended Registrants",
            "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
            "typeVersion": 2,
            "position": [
                1024,
                0
            ]
        },
        {
            "parameters": {
                "batchSize": 1,
                "options": {}
            },
            "id": "split-noshow-001",
            "name": "Split In Batches: 1",
            "type": "n8n-nodes-base.splitInBatches",
            "typeVersion": 3,
            "position": [
                1280,
                0
            ]
        },
        {
            "parameters": {
                "conditions": {
                    "options": {
                        "caseSensitive": false,
                        "leftValue": "",
                        "typeValidation": "loose",
                        "version": 2
                    },
                    "conditions": [
                        {
                            "operator": {
                                "operation": "gt",
                                "type": "number"
                            },
                            "rightValue": 0,
                            "id": "attended-check",
                            "leftValue": "{{ $json.is_attended }}"
                        }
                    ],
                    "combinator": "and"
                },
                "options": {}
            },
            "id": "d7d2e6bb-9f3f-458f-b584-75a163d479bf",
            "name": "IF: Is Attended?",
            "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
            "typeVersion": 2.2,
            "position": [
                1536,
                0
            ]
        },
        {
            "parameters": {
                "resource": "tagSubscriber",
                "operation": "add",
                "tagId": 19804957,
                "email": "={{ $json.email }}",
                "additionalFields": {}
            },
            "id": "dd222756-5dd8-46c3-86e5-70080f866e6e",
            "name": "Add No-Show Tag",
            "type": "n8n-nodes-base.convertKit",
            "typeVersion": 1,
            "position": [
                1792,
